          <caption>
            <p>Artery of Adamkiewicz. This illustration shows the anatomic relationships of the artery of Adamkiewicz and its branches with the T9 vertebra,&#x000a0;anterior spinal artery, posterior intercostal artery,&#x000a0;and aorta. StatPearls Illustration</p>
          </caption>
